        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-insight for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 horizontal w-container">
          <div class="column-wrapper">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2 left center-sm">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">What we learned</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2">Getting people interested <span class="span-pink-2">is only the first step</span></h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-3 opacity-80">People may be curious about Web3, but curiosity alone does not turn them into users. They still need to understand what the product does, what they gain from using it, and whether they feel confident enough to take part.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---01.avif" alt="A purple circle with a play button on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Many people who have never owned cryptocurrency say they still do not understand how it works. When the basics feel unclear, even a useful product can lose people before its value comes through. (The Motley Fool)</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---02.avif" alt="A purple button with a blue envelope on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">A large share of adults remain unsure whether cryptocurrency is safe or reliable. Web3 products need to give new users enough clarity to make their own informed decision. (Pew Research Center)</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple button with a speaker inside of it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Crypto scams and fraud took an estimated $17 billion in 2025. Every legitimate Web3 company is entering a market where new users are already more careful about what they support. (Chainalysis)</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple button with a shopping cart on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Many Web3 losses come from access-control failures rather than the underlying technology. Users need to understand how a platform approaches security, ownership, and accountability. (Hacken)</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-wrapper hide-small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67601fee10470581a90722d7/67602bd27d29b464069f8f7a_Key%20Insight.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-purpose for-whom">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 2401px) 100vw, 2401px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478540_2Frame-1707478540.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif 2401w" alt="" src="/images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-3">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-4">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">The Advantages</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2">How video turns interest <span class="span-pink-2">into participation</span></h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">A clear video gives new users the context, confidence, and direction they need to move from hearing about your product to actually taking part.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap-2">
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/web3-simplified-icon.svg" alt="" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Introduce</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Give newcomers the context they need without assuming they already understand wallets, tokens, protocols, or decentralised systems.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
