                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a2" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">It&#x27;s video content built to explain a blockchain, crypto, or decentralized project clearly, while also addressing the skepticism a lot of Web3 audiences start with. Some clients search for this as a crypto explainer video, it&#x27;s the same thing.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a7" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our space has a bad reputation because of scams. How do you help with that, not just the explanation?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14ab" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We lean on specifics rather than hype, real team members, real partners, real mechanics, rather than the kind of vague, exciting language that tends to read as a red flag to a skeptical audience. Showing your project clearly is itself part of building trust.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b0" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our audience is mostly newcomers who don&#x27;t understand blockchain at all. How technical should the video be?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Usually not very. We build for someone with zero prior knowledge first, then let anyone more experienced pick up the extra detail from context. Over-explaining thing they don&#x27;t conclusively understand yet tends to lose newcomers faster than under-explaining it.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can you help with a token launch video specifically?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14bd" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. These usually need to do two jobs at once, explain the tokenomics clearly and build genuine excitement, without tipping into the kind of hype language that makes people skeptical. We can talk through the balance during discovery.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c2" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Do you understand the difference between our various Web3 products, like an NFT app versus a gaming platform?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We treat each product as its own explanation rather than reusing the same script with different logos. This was the case for Venly, where we built three genuinely different videos for three genuinely different products under one engagement.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What if we need changes after the video is delivered?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We work with you until it&#x27;s right. If something needs adjusting after delivery, tell us what&#x27;s off and we&#x27;ll work through the changes with you rather than pointing at a revision policy.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="237b7cfb-96e6-8769-f68d-ac2269a2d687" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can we use the video across different platforms?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="237b7cfb-96e6-8769-f68d-ac2269a2d68b" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. We deliver your final video in the formats each channel needs, so the same project works on your website, social channels, and anywhere else you plan to use it.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="2d846315-32dc-4ab7-f973-0467c52bd3ab" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What&#x27;s the pricing structure, and how do I get started?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="2d846315-32dc-4ab7-f973-0467c52bd3af" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We offer a fixed price per video with a clear quote upfront, or a monthly subscription if you&#x27;re likely to need ongoing content. Book a call or request a free sample and we&#x27;ll ask a few questions about your project before quoting.</p>
